        "action",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "manage_dossier",
  },
  {
    "description": "Manage the learned human→artifact lexicon (v1.4). \`action\`: add (upsert a canonical target + the human phrases that refer to it; bumps evidence_count on repeats), lookup (expand a query via matching alias phrases), list (all aliases), remove (by canonical), compile (rebuild the derived cache). The lexicon maps how THIS human names things to concrete paths/symbols.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "action": {
