  },
  {
    "description": "Manage the speaker profile (v1.5) — the model of how THIS human communicates (severity calibration, chronic omissions, verbosity preference, non-entity shorthand). \`action\`: init (scaffold profile/speaker.md with the fixed sections), get (read it), update_section (append a learned line to — or replace — one section; scaffolds first if absent). Update it when the user corrects an interpretation ("no, when I say X I mean Y"). One human, one profile.",
    "inputSchema": {
