    "description": "Generate or refresh AGENTS.md at the project root with a managed-block contract. Preserves the 'Local Notes' tail across regenerations. Refuses to overwrite hand-edits inside the managed block unless force=true. Returns the path written and whether hand-edits were detected.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
